window.products.push({"id":491260,"name":"YAVIL Bed Tent Bed Canopy Full Size, Portable Sleeping Tents Dream Tents Indoor for Kids and Adult, Breathable Privacy Space on Bed with Three Doors (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QyBD29SxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PATENT PROTECTED DESIGN】YAVIL bed tent adopts a unique insert-rod design, more sturdy than other pop up bed tent on the market. 8MM fiber poles help this twin bed tent retain its shape and be more stable.Use it with your existing mattress to create your own private space for a warm and comfortable sleep.(Please Note: ONLY bed tent with no floor, mattresses not included) 【EASY ACCESS-WITH 3 DOORS】This full bed tent has three entrance doors with double zipper that can be opened or closed both inside and outside for your easily access. Each door has two layers of panels: the first is a breathable mesh that allows for good ventilation,the second is made of pongee fabric, black color to reduce light and no one can see inside but you can see outside. 【RELAXING PRIVATE SPACE】This full bed tent dimensions 75 x 54 x 47 inches, which is suitable for twin bed. It can be created a private space in dorm, shared room, office, and more, which means you can have more relaxing time. Bed tent also provides you a better sleeping during bedtime and nap time. You can adjust the panels to control the light as needed to create a cozy environment. 【QUICK INSTALLATION & STORAGE】Everyone can set up this twin bed tent in a few minutes.You just put the long pole through the corresponding side tunnel,then the fiber poles with plastic elbow to form 2 rectangular frames,and finally put the long pole through the plastic elbow and tie the belts & tunnels and fasten buckles.Besides,the bed tent comes with a carrying bag. When you are not using it, it can be folded up and put in your closet. 【STRONG CUSTOMER SERVICE】The storage bag inside the bed tent is also convenient for you to put your cell phone, books, and other things. This package includes 1 x full bed tent, 2 x fiber poles with plastic elbow, 4 x long fiber poles, 1 x storage bag. The portable bed tent is a great companion to enjoy solitude, and a great gift for your friends and family. If you have any questions about the bed tent, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QyBD29SxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YAVIL","source_asin":"B0C1Y999QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1Y999QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1Y999QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
