window.products.push({"id":491337,"name":"New Age Living BL1800 Commercial Grade Food & Smoothie Blender & Dry Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A8hi+b5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We normally sell this blender kit for $240 more, however for this this latest production run the manufacturer has mislabeled the pulse-mode switch (the default spring-loaded off position is labelled as \"on\"). For this reason we have marked it down by $240 and decided to blow-out this latest batch. This listing includes an extra 32 OZ Dry Jar & matching smaller size tamper. The New Age Living BL1800 was designed with input from our high volume smoothie shop customers. After using 4 generations of our popular BL1500 commercial smoothie blender, we decided to start from the ground up to create a blender that is even more robust, more powerful, and even easier to use.  The BL1800 is fully ETL certified, meaning it can be safely ran for extended periods of time without any reduction of performance or risk of overheating. With innovative built in cooling vents built right into the jar that help cool the motor as the blender runs. The latest generation pure copper wound motor has also been upgraded and now features larger bearings and drive shaft. This when combined with the redesigned blender feet, produces a very smooth blending action while minimizing unwanted vibrations. Blending fruits and vegetables at 35,000 RPM with a 3.5 horsepower (PEAK) motor has never been smoother. The 85 Oz Tritan jar is still BPA free, however it now features a redesigned metal drive socket that will never strip, along with a brand new stainless steel blade set that features six blades, with the bottom two being serrated (for unmatched blending and crushing ability). The bottom of the jar has also been squared off, making lining up the jar a breeze.  With countless of New Age Living blenders being put to work in smoothie shops and restaurants across the USA and Canada, the included 5 year warranty is a direct reflection of our confidence in the quality of these blenders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A8hi+b5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Age Living","source_asin":"B01A9C6R3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9C6R3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9C6R3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491338,"name":"OLIVIA & AIDEN Salad Spinner Set - Includes Large Salad Spinner With Colander and Dishwasher Safe Bowl, Lettuce Knife, and 3 Airtight Bag Clips - Sala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xulOpcRRL._AC_SL1117_.jpg","description":"SALAD SPINNER: The ultimate kitchen tool for salad lovers. Salad spinners include an outer bowl with an inner removable strainer basket. The cover contains a spinning mechanism that when initiated causes the inside strainer to rotate rapidly. Using a Salad Spinner after washing can provide a crisper salad by removing the excess water from your salad greens - the perfect lettuce dryer. Salad Spinners do a great job keeping lettuce undamaged while cleaning the leaves. The removal of water from the leaves allows for a more evenly dressed salad. Greens should always be dry before refrigerated storage, to prevent wilting thereby keeping your salad crisp. A Salad Spinner is the perfect salad dryer and will help if you are meal prepping for your week. PLASTIC LETTUCE KNIFE: A major problem with early salad preparation is the browning and wilting of the lettuce. Unlike a metal kitchen knife, a serrated plastic lettuce knife will not oxidize lettuce so the edges won’t turn brown - keeping a salad looking crisp and fresh. Designed with an angled blade and evenly serrated edge allows for clean and neat cuts leaving your salad looking fresh and desirable. Please note the use of this knife is not limited to lettuce. This is the perfect fruit knife, cake knife and vegetable chopping knife. AIRTIGHT BAG CLIPS: Gone are the days last minute salad preparation! Simply place your prepared lettuce in a bag, let out the excess air and seal the bag with an airtight clip and place in your refrigerator. Airtight storage is proven to extend the shelf life of perishables. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We take pride in our OLIVIA & AIDEN Salad Spinner Set. If you are not completely satisfied, please contact us for a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xulOpcRRL._AC_SL1117_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olivia's Home Goods","source_asin":"B074F4HFC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F4HFC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F4HFC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
