window.products.push({"id":491359,"name":"Inofia Full Gel Mattress Topper,3Inch Memory Foam Mattress Topper with Portable Storage Bag, Mobile Mattress,Camping Car Mattress (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RoAXe9etL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ⓜ️ Inofia Gelgem Mattress Topper Offers an instant upgrade to elevate your sleeping experience 1️⃣ For those customers who’re looking for the benefits of a memory foam mattress but don’t want to shell out too much money 2️⃣Adds a further layer of luxurious and orthopedic support to your mattress, enhancing comfort and support 3️⃣ CertiPUR-US certified, Healthy and Eco-Friendly, guarantee your family sleep with no concern 4️⃣ Rest easy, anywhere. Not only can be used in primary beds, but also can be used in RVs, hotels, college dorms, guest beds, or sofas. *Last but no least, no more worry about how to store your memory foam mattress topper when your guest finish visiting. each mattress topper comes with Velco and storage bag,it’s sturdy and very easy to keeping your toppers tidy and clean all day long. 🍀Please check the size before purchase ✅Twin-39”(W)x75”(L) -99x190cm ✅Full-54” (W)x75” (L) -137x190cm ✅Queen-60” (W)x80” (L) -152x203cm ✅California King-72” (W)x84” (L) -183x213 ✅King-76” (W)x80” (L) -193x203cm Package Include: 1 x Gelgem Mattress Topper 1 x User Manual There are 2 important things to remember when it comes to buying a memory foam mattress topper: - Your vacuum-packed mattress topper needs 24-72hour to fully recover - The mattress topper may come with “fresh foam” smell, please place it in the well-ventilated shade, the smell will dissipate soon then, It’s normal for a vacuum-packed memory foam topper Have customer service questions regarding a Inofia Mattress Topper? please freely contact us, we offer a 24-hour time customer support with fast and friendly service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RoAXe9etL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B07YX23FYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YX23FYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YX23FYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491360,"name":"Rancilio Silvia Espresso Machinet,0.3 liters, with Iron Frame and Stainless Steel Side Panels, 11.4 by 13.4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":865.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Btdyik0RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This popular traditional style semi-automatic espresso machine is built to last. Its strong linear designed housing is constructed of an iron frame and stainless steel side panels. Built with Rancilio's commercial grade group head for excellent heat stability and premium extraction quality. Features a patented ergonomic 58mm porta filter for superb extraction. These are the same porta filters used on Rancilio commercial machines. The single boiler of the Silvia has the largest volume capacity of any home machine in its class. Holding 0.3 liters (12oz) this chrome plated brass boiler produces outstanding steaming power and remarkable recovery time between shots. The two quart water reservoir can be removed or filled from the top at anytime during the operation. The Rancilio Silvia features an articulating stainless steel steam wand that allows for a complete range of motion for steaming perfect latte quality milk. Control steaming power with the commercially designed steam knob. This Silvia comes with a 7 gram coffee scoop, a plastic tamper and two filter baskets (single and double). This is the most current version of the Silvia available direct from the factory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Btdyik0RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rancilio","source_asin":"B00H1OUSD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H1OUSD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H1OUSD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491361,"name":"Hamilton Beach 022333226322 Proctor Silex 2 Slice Toaster with Auto Shut Off, Silver | 22632, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-htM5wZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quickly make perfect toast time after time and make your mornings a little brighter with the Hamilton Beach Proctor Silex 2 Slice Toaster It's the little things in life that make all the difference like delicious toast Loaded with features this toaster is no different The toast booster function lifts slices even higher so they're easier to reach away from the heat when done With the auto shut-off feature the toaster shuts off automatically after use - no more worries about leaving another kitchen appliance on Avoid those smoky smells in your kitchen and dining room by emptying out the drop-down crumb tray Finally crisp bread to your liking with the shade selector so you don't have to guess how long to cook your toast without burning it Get more toast and happy mornings out of your toaster with the Hamilton Beach Proctor Silex 2 Slice Toaster","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a-htM5wZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Proctor Silex","source_asin":"B00U3MCOCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U3MCOCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U3MCOCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
