window.products.push({"id":491409,"name":"PANWA Traditional Sticky Rice Cooking Basket (2 pc Set) - “NATURAL SCENTED” - Handcrafted THAI Bamboo Wing Design, Medium Size with 24x24 Inch Cheesec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91g6KCxbx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you ever had a taste of traditional Thai sticky rice, you know instantly that this is a treat you will want to learn how to make for your family and friends.  Cooking sticky rice in a bamboo steamer basket provides a natural way to cook rice without losing flavor, nutrients, shape, and color.  With this high quality “Traditional” Winged design sticky rice cooking basket, it’s time to transform your conventional recipe to amazing and authentic cuisine.  There are 2 distinct types of sticky rice baskets SMOKED OR NATURAL. The “smoked scented” version is hewn by a wood kiln fire that richly scents and permeates the basket, which in turn lightly flavors the sticky rice as it steams.  The “natural scented” version is not smoked and is air dried in the sun after it is constructed.  Be advised that this is NATURAL scented version and does not have a burnt wood aroma.  Most kitchens in Thailand are located outside the house and the burnt wood fragrance isn’t sensed.  Sticky rice, called “Kow neow” in the Thai language, is especially popular among the people from the north and northeastern areas of Thailand. Besides being household appliance, these baskets also function as kitchen adornments.  The more rugged they look, the more experienced the cook, and it’s viewed as a prized badge of honor that becomes both a keepsake and a pass down item to the next generation of Thai countryside Chefs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91g6KCxbx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PANWA","source_asin":"B08N5XD353","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N5XD353","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N5XD353","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
