window.products.push({"id":491571,"name":"POKALOTEA Tea Storage, Yixing Tea Canister, 12.34oz/350g Empty Tea Tin, Loose Leaf Tea Storage with Airtight Lid, Tea Storage Container, Tea Caddy, Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hST2mq9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As we all know light,heat and moist air can degrade the quality of loose tea The Yixing Empty Tea Tin can help you put the loose tea be stored in an airtight ceramic tea storage container,instead of storing your tea in places where sunlight reaches Unlike glass tea tin need to be stored in a dark cabinet or drawer and metal tea canister absorb heat easily, this ceramic tea storage container could keep the light out and keep away from heat more effectively Beautiful and poetical tea tin. keep tea fresh,suitable for tea storage,also can be used in the kitchen such as nuts foods coffee blueberry etc... Yixing is known collectively as zisha (purple sand) How are Empty Tea Tin made? Yixing Tea Tin are all hand-made rather than being thrown on the wheel. Basically It is made and fired with a kind of clay produced in Yixing through a complicated and time-consuming processing technique by craftsmen Specialised tools of wood, bamboo, metal and horn, created through the centuries, are used during the process. Yixing teapots and tea set lelated items have been made since the 16th century, and there has been a steady stream of known potters since the Wanli period (1573–1619). Where is the geographical location of Yixing Pottery has been produced in Yixing, situated to the west of Taihu, the Great Lake in Jiangsu Province, since the Neolithic period. The hills to the southeast of the county are endowed with rich clay deposits, and the centre of pottery-making is located around the small towns of Dingshan and Shushan, now known collectively as Dingshuzhen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hST2mq9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POKALOTEA","source_asin":"B09PFTC7CP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PFTC7CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PFTC7CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
