window.products.push({"id":491620,"name":"Kitchenlestar 10 Pack Soy Sauce Dishes Ceramic Dip Bowls Set, 1.2 Oz Dipping Sauce Bowls/Dishes, Sauce Dish for Ketchup, Soy, BBQ, Sushi, Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WyXY56soL._AC_.jpg","description":"Compact Size: Just palm-size, hold up to fluid 3.4 ounces, the capacity of sauce serving bowls is reasonable for daily use. Perfect for individual drippings, such as ketchup for French fries, butter for dripping shrimp, chutney, and olive oil. And they are able to serve little dishes, dessert, appetizer. Remarkable Stackability: 4\"L x 4\"W x 0.9\"H Space-saving, stackable design. they can be stored comfortably and steadily in the cabinet without taking too much space. Clean, elegant contours and bright white colour coordinate beautifully with other dinnerware. Sturdy and Easy to Clean: The dip bowls made of professional and top-grade porcelain, they will be lasting clean without the residual odour of the food. Soy sauce dish must be subjected to rigorous high-temperature testing to ensure it can withstand the oven, microwave. Safe temperature up to 590°F and resistance than other glass or plastic dipping sauce dish. A little Family Dinner Helper: You won't easily turn over the sauce because of the stable with round bowl bottom. Dishwasher, oven and microwave safe. Perfect for our snack night, and a nice gift for a friend during Christmas and Thanksgiving Day. Pro quality and service: No worries about the Porcelain quality and packaging. If there is any question or issue with our products, please contact us without hesitation. Our customer services are reliable and always ready to help you the best we can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WyXY56soL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHENLESTAR","source_asin":"B09QL6P2GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QL6P2GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QL6P2GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
