window.products.push({"id":491660,"name":"My Lucky Chinese Zodiac Rooster Statue Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mWp6ZJ1fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This feng shui item was specially designed to prevent infidelity from breaking up a family. In Feng Shui, the Rooster is a powerful feng shui remedy to repel vibrations of infidelity. It prevents third parties from interfering with a marriage or breaking up a family. By displaying rooster image in your living room, it will peak away those trying to create problems for your family and keep your family close together. Hence you can be sure of heavenly luck protecting your home against such person. It is also a potent symbol of protection and abundance. The rooster brings a wonderful peach blossom luck and harmony to the home. Petty office politics is common in most workplaces. The best way to counter such negative and counterproductive energy is to display the figurine of a Rooster in the office. This will help to quell arguments, backstabbing and politicking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mWp6ZJ1fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Lucky","source_asin":"B07FZHLGN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZHLGN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZHLGN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
