window.products.push({"id":491707,"name":"Frame It Easy 23 x 24 Merlot Wood Frame (Derby)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MpvRV+5VL._AC_.jpg","description":"This wood picture frame is custom cut, packaged, and shipped from our 25,000 square foot warehouse in Derby, Connecticut. This very popular 1 1/4\" flat-face Wood style is made from a North American Hardwood with a decorative wood pattern wrap. We pride ourselves on using quality materials to manufacture an affordable frame that is made in the USA. We ship your frame order via UPS, FedEx or USPS with extra sturdy shipping packaging. Before ordering: measure the exact height and width of your artwork in US inches. The exact measurement of your artwork 23\" (width) by 24\" (height) will fit this 23\" x 24\" frame. The frame lip will overlap the artwork edge by approximately 1/4 inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MpvRV+5VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frame It Easy","source_asin":"B07SSVXB6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSVXB6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSVXB6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491708,"name":"Normcore 49.7mm Coffee Tamper V4 - Spring-loaded Tamper - Barista Tools - Espresso Tamper with Mat For ROK Espresso Maker - Flat Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mwEg3YmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This V4 tamper has further improved on the central shaft design, also the interchangeable springs (15lb/ 25lb/ 30lb) are now applicable to the central shaft which provides pressure directly to the coffee grounds. Why NORMCORE Spring-loaded Tamper? Level Tamping - The ingenious design of leveling plate ensures your tamping level every time by resting on top of the filter basket as you press down on ground coffee. Consistent Pressure - The amount of pressure you apply is simply controlled by a pre-calibrated spring inside the tamper itself. Moreover, it comes with 3 interchangeable springs to suit your preference. Depth - Press and turn clockwise at the same time when tamping to create the best level result. This is the perfect tamper for both aspiring home baristas and busy cafes. 49.7mm: Perfect fit for the ROK Espresso Maker GC Tamper and ROK Presso Espresso Makers. The set includes: 1 - Spring Loaded Tamper 1 - Coffee Tamper Stand 1 - 30lb Spring 1 - 25lb Spring（Already installed ） 1 - 15lb Spring","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mwEg3YmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Normcore","source_asin":"B0BBXKYQ97","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBXKYQ97","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBXKYQ97","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
