window.products.push({"id":491825,"name":"Zap Impex Travel Game- Wooden Chess Set Magnetic Square (Size- 10 X 10 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ws4Que7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This chess set has storage fitted with EP Foam for keeping chess pieces safe. The magnet power gets attracted by the wooden board through the metal sheet that holds the chess pieces in place and never drops them while traveling or playing. And that's why we call it perfect set travel chess. Each piece of chess fits into the special insert, which was made according to the shape of the chess pieces. The chess pieces are hand carved in Staunton design in the combination of Golden Rosewood / Boxwood and special lacquer coating has been applied to all the chess pieces that are stored in the box. High powered magnets were used in the chess pieces by drilling hole in every chess piece. The strong magnet power does not drop the chess piece itself when the box is held in the head position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ws4Que7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zap Impex","source_asin":"B01LPXWCAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LPXWCAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LPXWCAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
