window.products.push({"id":491881,"name":"QTDLXFA Valentines Day Gnomes, Set of 4, Red & Pink Nisse Figurine, Stuffed Plush Swedish Nordic Tomte Scandinavian, Spring Home Decor Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71siPt4OrVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 Valentines Day Gnome with bendable hat designed. This decor gnome set is sure to make bring happiness and sweet to your lover and family. This Valentines Day decoration is constructed of love heart printing hat and heavy body finish. Pink and red color design good for spring home, party or table decorations. These gnomes are made of quality felt, plush nose, and fibrous white beard. The interior is filled with cotton and sand to make it soft and stand stable. 9 inches high from the bottom to the hat top and 4 inches wide. Package of 4 gnomes. A wire inside the hat make it bendable. This gnome set is the perfect accent for your Valentines Day. Little gnomes bring you an adorable spring color. Use one or more to line stairs, path or walkway. Also good for gift or party favor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71siPt4OrVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QTDLXFA","source_asin":"B09KTYFQT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTYFQT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTYFQT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491882,"name":"Enamel Stock Pot Chefs de Cuisine Enamelware Pot Enamel Cooking Pot with Glass Lid (5.8-qt. (5.5 L))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OPwOVjpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A white lightweight enameled pot, decorated with a lovely image of some busy Italian chefs! This vintage style pot will become a great addition to your kitchen interior!  Durable  Glass lid for easy monitoring cooking process  Heat resistant glass with a trap that allows steam to escape  Stainless steel rim  Suitable for all types of stoves  Avoid using abrasive cleaners and metallic pads  Dishwasher safe  Non-microwave-safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OPwOVjpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novomoskovsjka Posuda","source_asin":"B07TY2RDBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY2RDBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY2RDBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491883,"name":"ROXBURGH Wedding Cake Knife and Server Set Champagne Flutes, Modern Style Bride and Groom Champagne Flutes Toasting Glasses Engraved Mr and Mrs, Cake ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Smf+PjRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Elegant Design】 Say \" I do\" with this exquisite wedding champagne flutes and cake knife server set. Treat yourself to a modern, refined experience with this champagne glasses set of 2. With sleek, cylindrical shapes and stems filled with dazzling rhinestones, adding a personal touch to your special occasion. They offer a contemporary twist on the classic flute design, with a geometric interpretation that ensures you can savor the splendid color of your favorite bubbly in style! 【Crafted with Love】 Our newly upgraded Mr and Mrs Champagne Flutes feature refined designs with elegant engravings. The delicate silver print of \"Mr and Mrs\" is adorned with charming double hearts, representing eternal love. These champagne glasses are versatile enough to be used for any occasion, whether it's a formal wedding or a casual get-together. 【Premium Material】 These lead-free toasting flutes have a distinctive shape that is expertly crafted by skilled artisans with years of experience. The cake server set is fashioned from premium 304 stainless steel, ensuring durability and resilience. The cake knife and server are solid and provide a secure grip when in use. You can use them confidently for any special occasion. 【Versatile Occasions】 These stunning wedding champagne glasses and cake cutting set make an exceptional gift for not only bridal showers, engagements, and weddings, but also for birthdays, anniversaries, Valentine's Day, housewarming parties, or holiday gatherings. The exquisite wedding champagne flutes are guaranteed to enhance any celebration and create a delightful memory of the occasion that will be treasured forever. 【Package Includes】 Our package includes 2 stunning crystal champagne flutes, 1 sleek cake knife, 1 sophisticated pie server. Our wedding cake knife and server set arrives in a secure and stylish box that is sure to catch the eye of your loved ones, colleagues, or friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Smf+PjRbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROXBURGH","source_asin":"B0BZ44ZKC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ44ZKC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ44ZKC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491884,"name":"Pleasant Home 6 Piece Bath Towels Set – 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels, 2 Wash Cloths | Bathroom Towels | 100% Cotton | Soft & Absorbent Bath Towels | M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1NPSkL8o4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton AFFORDABLE QUALITY – This bulk bundle includes 2 Bath Towels (27” x 54”), 2 Hand Towels (16” x 27”) & 2 Wash Cloths (13” x 13”). Choose from five striking colors to match your bathroom décor. This elegant bath set can give a quick freshen up to your master bath or guest bathroom. COZY COTTON: Our towels are made of 100% Cotton with a tight knit weave, designed for maximum absorbency. The dense weave makes it super soft and snug when you’re drying off after a shower and blissfully wrapping it against your skin. CARE FOR YOUR TOWELS: Wash your towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. Always wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. Machine wash warm with mild detergent and tumble dry low. We advise against the use of fabric softeners which may reduce absorbency and may cause discoloration. HIGHLY ABSORBENT & QUICK DRYING: The 100% Cotton and dense weave makes these towels extraordinarily absorbent and also allowing for the towels to dry quicker. LONG-LASTING USE – Our towels are machine washable, dryer friendly and made to retain their softness and absorbency for years to come. Our premium towel set is an affordable alternative to Turkish or Egyptian towels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1NPSkL8o4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PH Pleasant Home","source_asin":"B089NYZWWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NYZWWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NYZWWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":491885,"name":"Luxr Blinds Pleated Fabric Temporary Shades with Pull Cord Operation: Easy Installation Light Filtering Blinds- White, 2 Pack, 36”x72”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vN8pJN53L._AC_.jpg","description":"HOW IT WORKS: Trim and adjust shades for a perfect fit by using any sharp scissors. Peel liner and stick right onto area that you want to install the shade. Shades are customizable for any window size from 36”x 72” to 18”x72”. Perfect solution for new home, apartment, studio, dorm room, RV, houseboat, moving, remodeling and campers that need instant setting up. EASY PEEL ‘N STICK INSTALLATION: We prepared the temporary shades to be completely ready to mount in just a few seconds. Avoid using tools like drills, hammers, screws or brackets. Our shades were produced with heavy-duty adhesive glue that will affix to any clean, smooth surface permanently. MADE WITH OBSCURE NON-WOVEN POLYESTER MATERIAL: Will softly filter light for privacy in your home, while allowing you to enjoy the natural light during the day. Best window treatment solution to protect against UV light, excessive sun glare and exterior heat penetration. CONVENIENT PULL-STRING DESIGN: Constructed with a smooth pull-string operation to easily raise and lower shades. Just pinch the spring lock to unlock cord and to adjust the shades to desired height. This will make the shade have a longer endurance, compared to other temporary pleated shades that are adjusted by clips. OPTIONAL CORD CLEAT INCLUDED: Install the cord cleat with screws to the side of the blind, at a height out of reach of children & wrap cord around cleat when not in use. CLEAN DESIGNER STYLE: Brighten and beautify your home with a sophisticated modern look that will match any décor. Our customizable beautiful textured polyester fabric window shades will enhance the look of just any room while gently adjusting the illumination of your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vN8pJN53L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxr Blinds","source_asin":"B078SZ83MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SZ83MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SZ83MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
