window.products.push({"id":491920,"name":"NewlineNY Mini Bathroom Scale + Travel Protection Case (Red-Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nGSg2pKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The NewlineNY Mini Travel Bathroom Scale is a new design featuring light weight & cool look. NewlineNY's \"care design\" included an elegant and soft protection slip case. It is safe & portable to monitor your scale when travelling to anywhere you go. The scale is small (12\"x6.25\"), but would not reduce the weighing function and accuracy. It's not only perfect for toddler, but excellent for teens or adults. This scale also comes with the latest \"Auto-Step-On\" technology. There is no need to tap, simply step on the scale to get a reading with 5 seconds automatic shut-off to preserve battery. The scale features a wide platform and a large LCD display. The Newline NY Ultra Slim Scale will be a great addition to fit in any home décor. Press the \"Unit\" press button on the back of scale to change from Kg to Lb or Stone. The protection slip case is great for travel protection of your mini scale for any trip. *** Scale must be placed on flat & hard floor for accurate weight; it will not work right on carpet or rug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nGSg2pKCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWLINE NY","source_asin":"B08RRTJQTB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RRTJQTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RRTJQTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
