window.products.push({"id":491932,"name":"JUSTOTRY Initial Beach Tote Bag - Large Utility Travel Bag for Women Personalized Bride Tote Birthday Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oxT9OIiaL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Canvas,Jute Imported Jute,Linen lining Buckle closure Machine Wash 👜【CLASSIC INITIAL MONOGRAM DESIGN】Our tote bags feature classic monogram personalized lettering with a beautiful flower trim, adding a touch of romance and personal charm to the design. The lettering can be customized with your name or a special message, making your tote bag unique and personal to you. The flower trim adds a delicate and graceful finishing touch, making this tote bag a fashionable and one-of-a-kind accessory for any occasion. 💎【LARGE CAPACITY & UTILITY】Our straw tote bags are designed with a large capacity and pockets to keep your belongings organized. (The Size is 16.5“x 12.2”x 4.72“) The main compartment is spacious enough to hold all your daily use, while the outer pockets provide easy access to smaller items such as keys and phone, making this reuseable tote bag a functional choice. With its versatile design and ample storage space, our big tote bags are sure to become your go-to accessory for all daily needs. ✔️【HIG QUALITY ECO-FRIENDLY JUTE MATERIAL】Our canvas tote bag is made of 100% high quality natural jute, which is a sustainable and eco-friendly material, you can use this large tote bag for a long time . The burlap is strong and durable, and the added waterproof coating on the inside ensures that your tote bag will last for many uses. The natural color of the linen adds a rustic and earthy touch to the bag, making it a stylish and eco-friendly choice. 😻【MULTIFUNCTIONAL PERSONALIZED GIFT】Our beach bags are multifunctional and can be used on a variety of occasions. They are perfect for everyday use, as a shopping bag, beach bag, tote bag, or as a very special personalized gift. Their large size allows you to carry all the essentials such as computers, lunch boxes, clothes, documents, book, and water bottle making them perfect for school, work, weddings, beach, wedding, bachelorette bridal shower, birthday gifts for women. 🔰【OUR GUARANTEE】If there is a problem with our jute tote bag, or you don't like it, we support the return and exchange. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. Come and Bring our personalized gifts to surprise your family and friends! !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oxT9OIiaL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUSTOTRY","source_asin":"B0BTY3V6FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTY3V6FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTY3V6FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
