window.products.push({"id":491964,"name":"Costzon Kids Vanity Set with Mirror, 2 in 1 Princess Makeup Dressing Table w/Detachable Top, Toddler Vanity with 360° Rotating Mirror, Drawer & Stool,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVIM9MzBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁Ideal Gift for Little Girls: Every little girl has a tiny dream of being a shiny princess. Our kids vanity set with mirror allows your little girl to dress up beautifully every day. With cute design, it will be an excellent addition to the children's room and deeply loved by kids. Whether on birthday or Christmas, it’s absolutely a great gift! 💄Detachable 360° Rotating Mirror: This vanity set comes with an oval mirror with high definition, offering a clear view for your little princess to observe her makeup, hairstyle and outfits. And the mirror can spin 360 degrees to achieve a perfect reflection. It is worth mentioning that the mirror can be removed, so that the vanity table can be used as a writing or reading desk if necessary. ✨Ample Storage Space: Apart from the spacious tabletop, there are 2 storage shelves as well as a practical built-in drawer to accommodate children’s beauty and study essentials. After making up or learning, kids can place and arrange their personal things neatly, forming a good finishing habit. 👍Sturdy & Stable Construction: Constructed of durable density board, our girls vanity set is sturdy enough and will provide long time service. The curved legs and reinforced structure enhance stability. Besides, considering children's safety, the vanity set is designed with round corners and smooth edges. 😊Easy to Assemble & Clean: With detailed graphic instructions and required accessories, our kids vanity table and stool set is easy to assemble without taking up too much time. And maybe your little child can help you complete this project together. Size of the table: 28” x 13” x 40” (L x W x H); size of the stool: 11” x 11” x 13” (L x W x H). Besides, the smooth and waterproof surface renders daily maintenance easier with a soft rag. 💖US CPSIA & ASTM Approved: Physical and mechanical hazards, flammability of toys, heavy metals and other items have passed ASTM F963-17 testing standards. The total lead and phthalates content meets the requirements as specified in US Consumer Product Safety Improvement Act. No sharp points or edges. Through stability, asphyxia, load, shear tests.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVIM9MzBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B0BG57T3VC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-491964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG57T3VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG57T3VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
